<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan seeks 225,000 T U.S. or Australian wheat.</title>
<headline>Pakistan seeks 225,000 T U.S. or Australian wheat.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan issued separate tenders on Saturday for 225,000 tonnes of U.S. soft white wheat and Australian white milling wheat for delivery between December 11 and 31, the Food and Agriculture Ministry said.</p>
</text>
